          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወአፉሆሙኒ ፡ ይነብብ ፡ ትዕቢተ ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አንደበታቸውም ፡ ትዕቢትን ፡ ይናገራል ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ማለት ፡ ትንሣኤ ፡ ሙታን ፡ የለም ፡ ይላል ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወያስተብፅሉ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እገሌ ፡ ከእገሌ ፥ እገሌ ፡ ከእገሌ ፡ እያሉ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰውን ፡ ከሰው ፡ ያበላልጣሉ ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወያደልዉ ፡ ለገጽ ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የሰውን ፡ ፊት ፡ አይተው ፡ ያደላሉ ። አን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድም ፡ መስለው ፡ ይታያሉ ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 3,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወዘ ፡ ኵሉ ፡ ዘይገብሩ ፡ ከመ ፡ ይርብሖሙ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይህ ፡ ሁሉ ፡ የሚሠሩት ፡ ጥቅማቸው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኀሣር ፡ ይሆንባቸው ፡ ዘንድ ፡ ነው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": "፲፯",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፯ ፤ ⟪ወአንትሙሰ ፡ አኀዊነ ፡ ተዘከሩ ፡ ቃለ ፡ ዘነ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ገሩክሙ ፡ ቀዲሙ ፡ ሐዋርያቲሁ ፡ ለእግዚእነ ፡ ኢየ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሱስ ፡ ክርስቶስ ፡ ወዘይቤሉክሙ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወንድሞቻችን ፡ እናንተ ፡ ግን ፡ ኢየሱስ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ክርስቶስ ፡ የሾማቸው ፡ ሐዋርያት ፡ ዘይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቤሉክሙ ፡ ወዘነገሩክሙ ፡ አንድ ፡ ወገን፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በጥንተ ፡ ስብከት ፡ የነገሯችሁን ፡ አስቡ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": "፲፰",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፰ ፤ ⟪ከመ ፡ በደኃሪ ፡ መዋዕል ፡ ይመጽኡ ፡ መስ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሕታን ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በኋላ ፡ ዘመን ፡ ሐሰተኞች ፡ መምህራን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንዲነሡ ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እለ ፡ ይሜህሩ ፡ በፍትወተ ፡ ልቦሙ ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልቡናቸው ፡ የወደደውን ፡ የሚያስተምሩ፤",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወያስሕቱ ፡ በኃጣውኢሆሙ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በኃጢአታቸው ፡ ሰውን ፡ የሚያስቱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፩ ፡ ጢሞ ፡ ፬ ፥ ፩ ። ፪ ፡ ጴጥ ፡ ፫ ፥ ፫ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": "፲፱",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፱ ፤ ⟪እሉ ፡ እሙንቱ ፡ እለ ፡ ይስሕቡ ፡ በጌጋዮሙ ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በኃጢአታቸው ፡ ሰውን ፡ ወደነሱ ። አን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድም ፡ ወደ ፡ ኃጢአታቸው ፡ የሚስቡ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
