          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወተሰፈውዋ ፡ ለምሕረቱ ፡ ለእግዚእነ ፡ ኢየሱስ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
