          "margin_tag": "፳፪",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፳፪ ፤ ⟪እስመ ፡ ቦ ፡ ለዘትዘልፍዎ ፡ በእንተ ፡ ኃጢአቱ ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስለ ፡ ኃጢአቱ ፡ የምትዘልፉት ፡ አለና ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወበፍቅሩ ፡ ለእግዚአብሔር ፡ ላለው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": "፳፫",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፳፫ ፤ ⟪ወቦ ፡ ለዘትምሕርዎ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የምትመክሩት ፡ የምታስተምሩት ፡ አለና፤",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሕንጹ ፡ ርእሰክሙ ፡ በሃይማኖት ፡ ላለው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
